     "paras": [
      "Repeat the exact words, then report when it's done. In the next lesson you do the same at the helm.",
      "An engine order is: speed + direction. <b>Dead slow / slow / half / full</b> + <b>ahead / astern</b>. <b>Stop engine</b> stands alone."
